@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description

state "Ordinary value only" as Ordinary
state "Temporary overlay active\n(ordinary value kept underneath)" as Overlay
state "Return applied" as Returned
state "Superseded by ordinary event" as Superseded
state "Return completed as fault emission" as Fault

[*] --> Ordinary
Ordinary --> Overlay : temporary event\n(lifetime Run or Until)
Overlay --> Returned : cancel / Until expiry /\nendRun or new run (Run)
Overlay --> Superseded : ordinary event for\naffected targets
Overlay --> Fault : return emits fault\n(never labeled success)
Returned --> Ordinary
Superseded --> Ordinary
Fault --> Ordinary
@enduml
